@startuml C4_Code_Command_Sequence

title Обработка команды устройства (C4 Code - Sequence Diagram)

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "Веб-приложение" as Web
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Device Controller" as Controller
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Validation Command Service" as Validation
participant "Command Handler" as CommandHandler
participant "Protocol Adapter Factory" as Factory
participant "MQTT Adapter" as Adapter
participant "State Manager" as StateManager
participant "Cache" as Cache
participant "Message Publisher" as Publisher
participant "Message Broker" as Broker
participant "MQTT Device" as Device

User -> Web: command (example: TURN_ON device)
Web -> Gateway: HTTP POST /api/v1/devices/{id}/commands\n{command: "TURN_ON"\nHeaders: Authorization: Bearer <JWT>}
Gateway -> Auth: validateToken(token)
Auth --> Gateway: token valid, userId, roles

Gateway -> Controller: handleCommand(deviceId, command)
Controller -> Validation: validateCommand(command)
Validation --> Controller: valid or invalid

alt Команда валидна
    Controller -> CommandHandler: processCommand(deviceId, command)
    CommandHandler -> Factory: getAdapter(deviceId)
    Factory --> CommandHandler: MQTTAdapter

    CommandHandler -> Adapter: isConnected()

    alt Устройство подключено
        Adapter --> CommandHandler: true
        CommandHandler -> Adapter: sendCommand(command)
        Adapter -> Adapter: validateCommand(command)
        Adapter -> Adapter: preparePayload(command)
        Adapter -> Device: MQTT PUBLISH\ntopic: cmd/{deviceId}/TURN_ON\npayload: {...}
        Device --> Adapter: MQTT ACK\ntopic: cmd/{deviceId}/ACK

        Adapter -> Adapter: parseResponse()
        Adapter --> CommandHandler: CommandResult(success=true)

        CommandHandler -> StateManager: updateState(deviceId, newState)
        StateManager -> Cache: SET device:{deviceId}:state\n{status: "ON", ...}
        Cache --> StateManager: OK
        StateManager -> Cache: EXPIRE device:{deviceId}:state\n3600

        CommandHandler -> Publisher: publishEvent(DeviceStateChanged)
        Publisher -> Broker: AMQP PUBLISH\ntopic: devices.state.changed\n{deviceId, newState, timestamp}
        Broker --> Publisher: ACK

        Publisher --> CommandHandler: published
        CommandHandler --> Controller: CommandResult(success=true)
    else Устройство не подключено
        Adapter --> CommandHandler: false
        CommandHandler -> Adapter: connect(deviceId)
        Adapter -> Device: MQTT CONNECT\nclient_id: service-{deviceId}
        Device --> Adapter: CONNACK

        alt Подключение успешно
            Adapter -> Adapter: subscribeToTopics()
            Adapter --> CommandHandler: connected
            CommandHandler -> Adapter: sendCommand(command)
            ... (как выше) ...
            CommandHandler --> Controller: CommandResult(success=true)
        else Ошибка подключения
            Adapter --> CommandHandler: connection failed
            CommandHandler --> Controller: CommandResult(success=false, error="Connection failed")
        end
    end

    Controller --> Gateway: HTTP 200 OK\n{success: true, ...}
else Команда невалидна
    Validation --> Controller: ValidationError
    Controller --> Gateway: HTTP 400 Bad Request\n{error: "Validation failed"}
end

Gateway --> Web: HTTP Response
Web --> User: Показать результат команды

note over Device, Broker
    Асинхронная обработка события другими сервисами:

    1. Heating Service подписан на devices.state.changed
       -> Если устройство термостат, обновить целевую температуру

    2. Scenario Service подписан на devices.state.changed
       -> Проверить условия сценариев
       -> Если условие выполнено, выполнить действия

    3. Telemetry Service подписан на devices.state.changed
       -> Сохранить новое состояние в TimescaleDB
end note

Broker ->> "Heating Service": AMQP Message\ndevices.state.changed
Broker ->> "Scenario Service": AMQP Message\ndevices.state.changed
Broker ->> "Telemetry Service": AMQP Message\ndevices.state.changed

@enduml
